* text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never apply line-ending normalization.
# Without these, `* text eol=lf` + core.autocrlf collapses every CRLF byte
# pair inside a binary to LF, corrupting the file on commit (a PNG's magic
# signature is 89 50 4E 47 0D 0A 1A 0A, so every PNG is guaranteed broken).
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.tga  binary
*.blp  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
# Packed asset containers, e.g. the desktop app's icons.bin — the same hazard as the
# images inside them, since the payload is concatenated JPEGs.
*.bin  binary
